<div class="text guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">
<div class="markup-toc-wrapper">
<button class="markup-toc-button">Show Table of Contents</button></div>Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear List for Feral Druid Tank in Cataclysm Classic Phase 4. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Twilight Protocol Dungeons and Valor Points. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="gearing-philosophy">
<span class="c11"> Feral Druid Tank Gearing Philosophy</span></h2>
<span class="c11">
<span class="icontiny" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_druid.gif");'>Feral Druid Tank</span></span> gearing is not straightforward, it depends heavily on what you're doing for your raid as a <span class="c11">
<span class="icontiny" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_druid.gif");'>Feral Druid Tank</span></span>. <span class="c11">
<span class="icontiny" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_druid.gif");'>Feral Druids</span></span> can do <i>everything</i> from Main-Tanking to Off-Tanking to DPSing, and even all these roles in the same encounter. Most <span class="c11">
<span class="icontiny" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_druid.gif");'>Feral Druid Tanks</span></span> however will be in the same situation that you're there to help the Main Tank with the Tank mechanics and use downtime to DPS in <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=768/cat-form">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_druid_catform.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cat Form</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>For this Pre-Raid Best in Slot list, there will only be 1 set that will focus fully on Survivability as that will give you the best start when you step foot into a new raid. This guide will be based on these <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-stat-priority-attributes-pve">Stat Priorities</a>, but the items mostly won't change so if you do wish to go more offensive or balanced in your gear set you can start with swapping out some enchants (alternatives in the item lists below) and some Stamina gems for Agility + Stamina gems.<br/>The Pre-Raid Best in Slot set will not include any PVP items, but the item lists below will include them as they're a good alternative due to how strong Stamina and Agility are for <span class="c11">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_druid.gif");'>Feral Druid Tanks</span></span>.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c11">Best in Slot Gear for Feral Druid Tank in Pre-Raid</span></h2>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
