<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Feral Druid Tank</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-feral-druid-tank">Head for Feral Druid Tank</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77148/nocturnal-gaze">
