<img alt="Seal of Primordial Shadow" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ring_generic_2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of Primordial Shadow</span></a> will be the two Pre-Raid Best in Slot Rings for this phase. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78421/signet-of-grasping-mouths">
<img alt="Signet of Grasping Mouths" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_103.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of Grasping Mouths</span></a> is only slightly worse than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78494/seal-of-primordial-shadow">
<img alt="Seal of Primordial Shadow" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ring_generic_2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of Primordial Shadow</span></a> but <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77111/emergency-descent-loop">
<img alt="Emergency Descent Loop" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_89.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emergency Descent Loop</span></a> is quite a lot better.<div class="pad"></div>
