<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="defensive-trinkets-for-feral-druid-tank">Defensive Trinkets for Feral Druid Tank</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77983/indomitable-pride">
<img alt="Indomitable Pride" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qirajidol_rebirth.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Indomitable Pride</span></a> is by far your best defensive Trinket, no matter what version (LFR/<wbr/>Normal/<wbr/>Heroic) of it you have it will be better than all the other Trinkets on this list. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77994/wrath-of-unchaining">
<img alt="Wrath of Unchaining" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_coin_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrath of Unchaining</span></a> Stamina is king, and this will be the highest Stamina trinket you can get Pre-Raid, to buy it you need 1x <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68915/scales-of-life">
<img alt="Scales of Life" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_druid_balanceofpower.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scales of Life</span></a>, which is a Binds when Equipped item from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a>, and 1x <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71617/crystallized-firestone">
<img alt="Crystallized Firestone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_diablostone.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crystallized Firestone</span></a> which you can buy with 50 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3281/obsidian-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Obsidian Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Fragment</span></span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
